From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: World of Warcraft <warcraft@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:52:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] G3D: stat in place of stat64 on musl

musl's stat is 64-bit, and since 1.2.4 it no longer has the large-file names (stat64) that glibc
keeps. FileSystem::_size used them.
---
 dep/src/g3dlite/FileSystem.cpp | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dep/src/g3dlite/FileSystem.cpp b/dep/src/g3dlite/FileSystem.cpp
index 06e6ff0..35cf1db 100644
--- a/dep/src/g3dlite/FileSystem.cpp
+++ b/dep/src/g3dlite/FileSystem.cpp
@@ -33,6 +33,10 @@
 #else
 #   include <dirent.h>
 #   include <fnmatch.h>
+    // musl's stat is 64-bit already and it has no stat64 (glibc's large-file names).
+#   if !defined(__GLIBC__) && !defined(__APPLE__)
+#       define stat64 stat
+#   endif
 #   include <unistd.h>
 #   define _getcwd getcwd
 #   define _stat stat
